<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="ast-interactive-tables">
  <title>TanStack AST Interactive Tables</title>
  <shortdesc
  >Documentation and live examples for dynamic interactive tables using TanStack Table and DITA AST generation.</shortdesc>
  <body outputclass="language-markup">
    <p>The <term
      >DITA Bootstrap AST</term> plug-in emits high-level semantic AST nodes for tables configured with interactive attributes in <xmlatt
      >otherprops</xmlatt>. The React Harness renderer processes these AST nodes into live <term
      >TanStack Table</term> components with dynamic search, sorting, pagination, column toggling, CSV export, and sticky headers.</p>

    <section>
      <title>Search &amp; Filtering</title>
      <p>Add <xmlelement>table otherprops="search pagination-10"</xmlelement> to enable global search filtering.</p>
    </section>
    <bodydiv outputclass="bd-example" deliveryTarget="html">
      <table outputclass="table-striped" otherprops="search pagination-10">
        <tgroup cols="3">
          <colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="2*"/>
          <colspec colname="COLSPEC1" colwidth="2*"/>
          <colspec colname="COLSPEC2" colwidth="1*"/>
          <thead>
            <row>
              <entry colname="COLSPEC0" valign="top">Animal</entry>
              <entry colname="COLSPEC1" valign="top">Species</entry>
              <entry colname="COLSPEC2" valign="top">Gestation (Days)</entry>
            </row>
          </thead>
          <tbody conref="gestation.dita#gestation/data">
            <row><entry/><entry/><entry/></row>
          </tbody>
        </tgroup>
      </table>
    </bodydiv>

    <section>
      <title>Sorting &amp; Column Visibility Toggle</title>
      <p>Add <xmlelement
        >table otherprops="sortable column-toggle pagination-10"</xmlelement> to allow sorting and column toggling.</p>
    </section>
    <bodydiv outputclass="bd-example" deliveryTarget="html">
      <table outputclass="table-striped" otherprops="sortable column-toggle pagination-10">
        <tgroup cols="3">
          <colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="2*"/>
          <colspec colname="COLSPEC1" colwidth="2*"/>
          <colspec colname="COLSPEC2" colwidth="1*"/>
          <thead>
            <row>
              <entry colname="COLSPEC0" valign="top">Animal</entry>
              <entry colname="COLSPEC1" valign="top">Species</entry>
              <entry colname="COLSPEC2" valign="top">Gestation (Days)</entry>
            </row>
          </thead>
          <tbody conref="gestation.dita#gestation/data">
            <row><entry/><entry/><entry/></row>
          </tbody>
        </tgroup>
      </table>
    </bodydiv>

    <section>
      <title>CSV Data Export</title>
      <p>Add <xmlelement
        >table otherprops="search export pagination-10"</xmlelement> to enable client-side CSV downloads of visible dataset rows.</p>
    </section>
    <bodydiv outputclass="bd-example" deliveryTarget="html">
      <table outputclass="table-striped" otherprops="search export pagination-10">
        <tgroup cols="3">
          <colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="2*"/>
          <colspec colname="COLSPEC1" colwidth="2*"/>
          <colspec colname="COLSPEC2" colwidth="1*"/>
          <thead>
            <row>
              <entry colname="COLSPEC0" valign="top">Animal</entry>
              <entry colname="COLSPEC1" valign="top">Species</entry>
              <entry colname="COLSPEC2" valign="top">Gestation (Days)</entry>
            </row>
          </thead>
          <tbody conref="gestation.dita#gestation/data">
            <row><entry/><entry/><entry/></row>
          </tbody>
        </tgroup>
      </table>
    </bodydiv>

    <section>
      <title>All Features Combined (Search, Sort, Pagination, Export, Column Toggle, Sticky Header)</title>
      <p>Combine all interactive table capabilities using <xmlelement
        >table otherprops="search sortable pagination-10 export column-toggle sticky-header"</xmlelement>.</p>
    </section>
    <bodydiv outputclass="bd-example" deliveryTarget="html">
      <table outputclass="table-striped" otherprops="search sortable pagination-10 export column-toggle sticky-header">
        <tgroup cols="3">
          <colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="2*"/>
          <colspec colname="COLSPEC1" colwidth="2*"/>
          <colspec colname="COLSPEC2" colwidth="1*"/>
          <thead>
            <row>
              <entry colname="COLSPEC0" valign="top">Animal</entry>
              <entry colname="COLSPEC1" valign="top">Species</entry>
              <entry colname="COLSPEC2" valign="top">Gestation (Days)</entry>
            </row>
          </thead>
          <tbody conref="gestation.dita#gestation/data">
            <row><entry/><entry/><entry/></row>
          </tbody>
        </tgroup>
      </table>
    </bodydiv>
  </body>
</topic>
